# The third-party tools build/linux/appimage.sh downloads and runs, each fixed
# to an upstream release tag (or commit) and checked against the SHA-256 here
# before it is made executable. Columns: SHA-256, file name, URL. To move to a
# newer release, change the URL and the hash together, and run the release
# workflow's dry run (Actions → Release → Run workflow, no prerelease) to see
# the AppImage still builds and passes its smoke test.
#
# linuxdeploy 1-alpha-20251107-1; linuxdeploy-plugin-appimage
# 1-alpha-20250213-1; linuxdeploy-plugin-gtk at commit 7a3fbc3 (it has no
# releases).
